{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de9c61bf0394e4b7ab4f13fd0b0f0bec68a5c701e0b98b636d48a20f5fa8a57e", "ja": "（今日は郵便屋さんのお仕事ポスター撮影に来ている。\nもうすぐ本番だけど、エミリーの様子は……）", "zh": "（今天来拍摄邮递员工作宣传海报。\n马上就要正式开拍了，艾米莉的情况怎么样了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "7b19752092994ec42bbcbfb44610a6867f15f83336df3ab1edb9dc308591b41f", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、お疲れさまです！\n今日もよろしくお願いいたします♪", "zh": "制作人先生，辛苦了！\n今天也请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1002_p", "source_sha256": "267e02f9fda44ef16ee395b3b3bb143286f54ab1f3fc96ad6809861ffe0d9431", "ja": "お疲れさま、エミリー。もうすぐ撮影が始まるけど、\n本番前に確認しておきたいことはないか？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾米莉。拍摄马上就要开始了，\n在正式拍摄前，有没有什么想确认的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "8ca65a7796dd890b1db83d6839e43e92b000d14702f8edc84c3aa3ed6f503657", "ja": "確認……あっ、そうでした！　仕掛け人さま。\n私、ひとつ気になっていることがあるのですが……。", "zh": "确认……啊，对了！制作人先生。\n我有一件事一直有点在意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "d5a0e1aae6aa802ff9901cff90ec4017f386f7ee803f88b4487c3605d72186bb", "ja": "今日の撮影は、郵便屋さんとうかがっております。\n郵便屋さんと飛脚とは、違うものなのですか？", "zh": "听说今天要拍摄的是邮递员。\n邮递员和飞脚，是不一样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1005_p", "source_sha256": "94a60765d999907fe18b6150e3b4f7e0a07b0f467690699e0e2f5514583feba4", "ja": "飛脚って、時代劇とかに出てくる……？", "zh": "飞脚，是时代剧里会出现的那种……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "018d54e773364602dda20dc602feed703ba4ab66086f96e0828d0dade7e65377", "ja": "はい！　大切な手紙や情報を届けるため、\n昼夜を問わず日本中を駆けまわり……。", "zh": "是的！为了传递重要的信件和情报，他们不分昼夜地奔波在日本各地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "968bf7786eddfd9448ebcc95d96baf8f1bec9ec83eeea09498e8f6e38e4a91fa", "ja": "時に雨の中を、時に雪深い道をひた走る、\n立派なお仕事ですよね！", "zh": "有时冒雨奔跑，有时踏过积雪深深的道路，\n真是了不起的工作呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5698b62bab9a12315a8e083629a2855b58958d4eba0e19ff531b1fe08788063e", "ja": "うん……そうだな。そういう意味では、\n飛脚は郵便屋さんの元祖みたいなものかな？", "zh": "嗯……确实。从这种意义上来说，\n飞脚就相当于邮递员的鼻祖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "e622cec280afdb9f2bc91bfbe79e0943f6876bfe9eafeed04e95f4f835f09b4e", "ja": "Wow……！　つまり今日の私は、\n現代の飛脚になるということなのですね！", "zh": "Wow……！也就是说今天的我，\n要成为现代的飞脚了对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "13939ea98fcb293f6578c09fac6af1a635d01496fdc558e20689cc9575867930", "ja": "さすが、仕掛け人さまです♪　こんなにも\n素敵なお仕事を、私にさせてくださるなんて……。", "zh": "不愧是制作人♪ 居然愿意让我做这么棒的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "021390e04776d354c935cc715ac19d100670d1b3e133b78e8adb88381472aea5", "ja": "仕掛け人さま。私、必ずみなさんのところへ、\nお預かりした手紙をお届けしてみせますね♪", "zh": "制作人大人。我一定会把托付给我的信，送到大家手中的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cd94ee20c72d44646b2beb27b7e7d4520443409ace16ddf0a33504340875c76b", "ja": "ああ、よろしく！　けど、手紙か……\nよく考えると、ずいぶん書いてない気がするな。", "zh": "啊，拜托你了！不过，信啊……\n仔细想想，我好像已经很久没写信了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "f2d7f82ec43523bae5f63f9f18ff075d5e69981e62653c9726937fef940bf215", "ja": "えっ？　そうなのですか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1014_p", "source_sha256": "61fdd2872818f187c32d7930a3c092a8a77cb147c23baf0b9d7b787ca07e347c", "ja": "そうだな。\n今時はスマホがあるから……。", "zh": "是啊。现在这个时代都有智能手机了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "5dad99468554ed364be9636d4240e288be35a1f67d562bc32597e1dab8ce3d37", "ja": "そうですか……。\nでは仕掛け人さま、こうしませんか？", "zh": "这样啊……那么制作人，我们这样做怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "f04114e9fd545be7d4ba11546fd07d4be346478e1d1a9c70c2484fc8a3f09e24", "ja": "仕掛け人さまに手紙を書いていただいて、\n私がそれを、他の手紙と一緒にお届けするんです。", "zh": "请您给制作人写封信，\n由我和其他信件一起送过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "4f3e5ede241b1dfe1992cd2fe3ca4df95d079c407b893f3bf12065d9a06110f3", "ja": "電子便りでは伝えられない気持ちも、\n手紙でなら伝えることができるのではありませんか？", "zh": "有些无法通过电子消息传达的心情，用书信不是也能传达出去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6e759485ed79d1cba21d25d332d4f72a59bfa8ca20b5a848b591f8b5d7d4c201", "ja": "なるほど……うん、いいかもしれないな。\nじゃあエミリーに、お願いしてみようかな。", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，或许可以试试。\n那就拜托艾米莉试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "8ee5c927f625530d5ba28a409c95e6b7b791d22b17d4cc4544208be8e3f79af5", "ja": "はいっ、おまかせください♪　届く速さは、\n飛脚や電子便りには敵わないかもしれませんが……。", "zh": "好的，请交给我吧♪　传递的速度或许比不上飞脚或电子信件，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "f82c2b59385c789b6d0d703fd579b2427f311195abc9004eeb70b2b879085ed4", "ja": "仕掛け人さまのお気持ちは、\n私が必ずや、お届けしてみせますね♪", "zh": "制作人先生的心意，\n我一定会替您送达的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0a48d5a2168d3cc10d3bf635c76ce1d01adc72cc57a58025076b21304d95fc34", "ja": "（エミリーの表情は自信に満ちている。彼女ならば\nきっと、みんなの大切な気持ちを届けてくれるだろう）", "zh": "（艾米莉的表情充满自信。她一定能把大家珍贵的心意传达出去吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_032emi0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_032emi0184_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bed1dc04f30f22fe74ffc3a1364927bea13678e49a1bc5cb8951aec0e4e32aed", "ja": "（さて、それじゃ俺も内容を考えようかな。\n頑張り屋のエミリーへ送る、労りの手紙の内容を）", "zh": "（那么，我也来想想内容吧。\n写一封送给努力的艾米莉、慰劳她的信。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
